public static String backslashUnescape(String x) {
    if (!x.contains("\\")) {
        return x;
    }
    StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder(x.length());
    for (int pos = 0; pos < x.length(); pos++) {
        char c = x.charAt(pos);
        if (c == ' ') {
            c = x.charAt(++pos); // skip backslash, get next char
        }
        sb.append(c);
    }
    return sb.toString();
}
```

This method effectively removes all backslashes from the input string, leaving only the characters that were not preceded by a backslash.

